Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why do highways
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop runaway cars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,with thin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel cables?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.95,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,that crosses the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,median is headed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:06.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,into oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:07.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,So three steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.97,0:00:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,ropes are strung
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:09.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,tight between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,flimsy posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:11.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:11.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits them, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:12.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,posts just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,fold over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:14.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,The cables stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:14.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,back like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,slingshot, about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,eight feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:17.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,That long stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:18.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,slows the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:19.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,gently instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:20.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,stopping it dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:22.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,steers it back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,along the median,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:24.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,away from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:24.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,other lanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:25.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:25.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:26.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:27.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's what those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:28.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,wires down the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:29.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,middle of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,highway are for.
